# Grub, Storied Matriarch // Grub, Notorious Auntie (CR 701.28, 712.8, 603.1): at the beginning of Bot1's first main phase it may pay {R} to
# transform Grub, and the Auntie may pay {B} to transform back. Only transforming into Grub, Storied Matriarch returns a Goblin card
# from the graveyard: on turn 3 Grub turns into the Auntie and nothing triggers; on turn 5 it turns back and the Goblin Grappler that
# Bot2's Lightning Bolt killed on turn 2 is returned.

